   <narrative xml:lang="SV">KI - expertst&#xf6;d behovsbed&#xf6;mn &amp; utv hum katastrofer</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KI - helpdesk needs assess &amp; eval hum catastroph</narrative>
