  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Genom till&#xe4;mpad forskning bidra till f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrade humanit&#xe4;ra insatser  vid pl&#xf6;tsliga katastrofer med fokus p&#xe5; &#xf6;kad kvalitet och samordning   av medicinsk humanit&#xe4;rt bist&#xe5;nd och ett forskningsbaserat ramverk f&#xf6;r behovsbed&#xf6;mningar samt utbildning och seminarier f&#xf6;r                  kompetensutveckling.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through applied research contribute to improved humanitarian          interventions in sudden disasters with a focus on improved quality    and coordination of medical humanitarian assistance and a research    based framework for needs assessments and severity scoring as well as education and seminars for competence development.</narrative>
